1
00:00:00,049 --> 00:00:01,476
Puluhan tahun,

2
00:00:01,476 --> 00:00:04,699
pilot melaporkan kilatan
aneh di atas badai...

3
00:00:04,699 --> 00:00:06,835
Tapi ilmuwan meragukannya.

4
00:00:06,835 --> 00:00:08,932
Kilatannya cuma beberapa milidetik.

5
00:00:08,932 --> 00:00:10,641
Sampai sebuah kamera...

6
00:00:10,641 --> 00:00:12,417
tak sengaja merekamnya.

7
00:00:12,417 --> 00:00:14,097
Namanya red sprite:

8
00:00:14,097 --> 00:00:15,534
kilat merah raksasa,

9
00:00:15,534 --> 00:00:17,350
nyaris di tepi luar angkasa.

10
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:18,459
September lalu,

11
00:00:18,459 --> 00:00:20,583
fotografer Prancis memotretnya...

12
00:00:20,583 --> 00:00:23,256
seolah melayang di atas desa di Korsika.

13
00:00:23,256 --> 00:00:25,165
Padahal badainya di Spanyol,

14
00:00:25,165 --> 00:00:27,506
lebih dari 500 kilometer jauhnya!

15
00:00:27,506 --> 00:00:29,937
Kirim ke temanmu yang takut petir!
